@startuml state_ocr_status__all
title États — Statut OCR (AccountingEntry.ocr_status)

[*] --> pending

pending --> verified : OCR cohérent
pending --> mismatch : incohérences détectées
pending --> failed : erreur OCR

mismatch --> manual_verified : validation manuelle
mismatch --> verified : correction + OCR cohérent
failed --> pending : retry OCR

manual_verified --> verified : (optionnel) contrôle final

note right of pending
  Normalisation (App\\Support\\OcrStatus::normalize):
  - inconnus => pending
  - legacy "mismatched" => mismatch
end note

@enduml

@startuml state_premium_cycle__all
title États — Cycle Premium (lecture applicative)

[*] --> free
free --> trialing : activation essai
trialing --> active : conversion premium
trialing --> free : essai expiré / retour gratuit
active --> free : fin de période / annulation

note right of active
  User::hasActivePremiumPeriod():
  - is_premium = true
  - premium_ends_at future (ou null)
end note

@enduml

@startuml state_investment_request_workflow__all
title États — Workflow d'une demande d'investissement (InvestmentRequest.status)

[*] --> pending

pending --> in_review : updateRequestWorkflow(next_status=in_review)
pending --> declined : updateRequestWorkflow(next_status=declined)

in_review --> accepted : updateRequestWorkflow(next_status=accepted)\n(note obligatoire)
in_review --> declined : updateRequestWorkflow(next_status=declined)\n(note obligatoire)

accepted --> [*]
declined --> [*]

note right of pending
  Transitions autorisées (InvestorController::ALLOWED_TRANSITIONS):
  pending -> in_review|declined
  in_review -> accepted|declined
  accepted -> (aucune)
  declined -> (aucune)
end note

@enduml

@startuml state_treasury_period_lock__all
title États — Gouvernance trésorerie (TreasuryPeriodLock)

[*] --> unlocked

unlocked --> locked : lockTreasuryPeriod(period_month)\nlocked_at, locked_by
locked --> unlocked : unlockTreasuryPeriod(period_month)\n(sauf si validé)

locked --> validated : validateTreasuryForecast(period_month)\nvalidated_at, validated_by
validated --> validated : (verrou maintenu)

note right of locked
  Règle : un verrou validé (validated_at != null)
  ne peut pas être déverrouillé via l'UI.
end note

@enduml

